{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうご存知かと思いますが、今年の紅白歌合戦、残念ながら乃木坂46は出場できませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、すごい悔しい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はもしかしたら...って、少し希望を持っていたので。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年こそは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう目標もできたし、そこに向かってみんなで気持ちを入れ替えて、前向きに頑張っていきたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は歌番組に収録に撮影にライブにリハーサルに、毎日充実しています(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベストヒット歌謡祭2014にベストアーティスト2014皆さんは見てくれましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日は、FNS歌謡祭があります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46も出演しますので、見てくださいね♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/11/30/5696955/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"27日は、10thの特典イベントでした(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の似顔絵会、私は絵が得意ではないので、半分は文字で埋めました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しかったよ(*^◯^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブはアンダーの曲